  "obligation": "Admit shared linear memory declarations/imports with a required maximum and exact sharedness; retain one original synchronized backing store through existing heap ownership, memory operations and growth.",
  "representation": "Validated MemoryType remains the authority for width, page size, sharedness and limits. The existing WasmMemory cell now owns Arc<MemoryStorage>; one Mutex<Vec<u8>> serves both shared and unshared memories. A read view distinguishes immutable data segments from locked linear memory. Imports retain the original cell; no copied owner, shared flag, executor or identity map is added. Copy handles identical backing and orders distinct backing locks to avoid opposing-copy deadlocks. Growth releases the guard before heap accounting. Standard spectest shared_memory is a real rooted shared memory resource; its private host-resource feature set does not alter guest suite feature policies.",
